        "FAILED, CANCELLED...), its steps and the approvals it waits for. wait_seconds (0-45) "
        "waits until it finishes or needs an approval. Approvals are given by people in the "
        "web UI, never by you."),
     "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {
