         "required": ["run_id"]}},
    {"name": "run_report", "description": (
        "Results of a run: summary and Quality Gates, findings by severity with file:line and "
        "the tool that found them, the Markdown report."),
     "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"run_id": RUN_ID}, "required": ["run_id"]}},
    {"name": "start_task", "description": (
        "Hand a task to the platform's orchestrator: its own agents implement it with tests "
